@startuml
title 手続きテクスチャを分けて検証する構成
top to bottom direction
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing true
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam defaultFontName Yu Gothic UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 18
skinparam rectangle {
  RoundCorner 24
  BorderColor black
  BackgroundColor #f7fbff
}
rectangle "ProceduralTileSpec\n部材寸法・目地・色・表面形状" as Spec #eaf7e8
rectangle "CPU参照版\n画素値の正しさを判定" as CPU #fff5df
rectangle "ComputeProceduralTile\nColor / Height / NormalをGPU生成" as GPU #f4edff
rectangle "比較処理とGpuReadback\n必要な検証時だけ同期" as Compare #fff5df
rectangle "ProceduralMaterial\n生成textureとPBR外観" as Material #eaf7e8
rectangle "Shape\n実寸UVをGPU bufferへ確定" as Shape #fdeaea
Spec --> CPU
Spec --> GPU
CPU --> Compare
GPU --> Compare
GPU --> Material
Material --> Shape
note right of Compare
通常描画ではreadbackしない
CPUは基準、GPUは実利用を担当
end note
@enduml
